Frequently Asked Questions

Q: What is the minimum attendance required?

A: Students must maintain at least 75% attendance.

Q: Can I use my mobile phone during examinations?

A: No. Mobile phones and electronic gadgets are prohibited.

Q: How many books can I borrow?

A: Four books for fourteen days.

Q: What is the hostel curfew time?

A: Students must return before 9:00 PM.

Q: What is the library timing?

A: 8:30 AM to 8:00 PM.

Q: What CGPA is required for placements?

A: Most companies require a minimum 7.0 CGPA.